{
  "bookId": "hero-214006",
  "id": "bond-26042",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26042001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "你看现在几点了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "七点三十一分——你迟到了，主人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可是……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "不用狡辩，迟到一分钟也是违纪。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "即使你是我的主人，我也不会手下留情的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "扣1分！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但今天是星期天！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "星期天？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没错，星期天不算迟到！\n而且上周约好今天一起喂流浪猫，你忘记了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "我说的就是这个——约好的是七点三十分，但你……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好了好了快走吧，再拖下去小猫该饿了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "但……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "猫粮、猫碗装好了吗？还有纯净水……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26042015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "冈田桜介",
          "text": "哼……这次就放过你，下不为例！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "26042",
